msgid "Install Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Whether you will work locally or in a cloud environment, the first step for "
"all users is to install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sama ada anda bekerja secara tempatan atau dalam persekitaran awan, langkah "
"pertama bagi semua pengguna ialah memasang Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Upgrade from Qiskit 0.x to Qiskit 1.0 and beyond\">\n"
"  (If you are installing Qiskit for the first time, skip ahead to the [Install and set up](#local) section. This notice is relevant only to users who have installed Qiskit previously.)\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Naik taraf dari Qiskit 0.x ke Qiskit 1.0 dan ke atas\">\n"
"  (Jika anda memasang Qiskit buat kali pertama, langkau ke bahagian [Pasang dan sediakan](#local). Notis ini hanya berkaitan untuk pengguna yang telah memasang Qiskit sebelum ini.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  **For those upgrading from version 0.x to 1.0 or later**: note that "
"because Qiskit v1.0 uses a new packaging structure, you **cannot** use `pip "
"install -U qiskit` to upgrade from any Qiskit 0.x version to 1.0.\n"
msgstr ""
"  **Bagi mereka yang menaik taraf dari versi 0.x ke 1.0 atau lebih baru**: "
"perhatikan bahawa kerana Qiskit v1.0 menggunakan struktur pembungkusan "
"baharu, anda **tidak boleh** menggunakan `pip install -U qiskit` untuk "
"menaik taraf dari mana-mana versi Qiskit 0.x ke 1.0.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  See the [Qiskit 1.0 migration guide](/guides/qiskit-1.0) for details and "
"instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Lihat [panduan migrasi Qiskit 1.0](/guides/qiskit-1.0) untuk butiran dan "
"arahan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Future updates starting with Qiskit 1.0 will allow for in-place upgrades.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kemas kini masa hadapan bermula dengan Qiskit 1.0 akan membenarkan naik taraf secara langsung.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

