# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Install pip](https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/installation/) if it's not "
"already installed in your environment. Pip is a Python package manager that "
"you use to install Qiskit and other Python packages. Use `pip list` to see "
"what is in your virtual environment. In most Python environments, pip is "
"already installed.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Pasang pip](https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/installation/) jika ia belum "
"dipasang dalam persekitaran anda. Pip ialah pengurus pakej Python yang anda "
"gunakan untuk memasang Qiskit dan pakej Python lain. Gunakan `pip list` "
"untuk melihat apa yang ada dalam persekitaran maya anda. Dalam kebanyakan "
"persekitaran Python, pip sudah dipasang.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit SDK.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install qiskit\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install qiskit\n"
"      ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      <Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Add visualization support\">\n"
"      If you intend to use visualization functionality or Jupyter notebooks, also install the `qiskit.visualization` module. See the [Visualizations API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) for more information.\n"
"      </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"      <Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Tambah sokongan visualisasi\">\n"
"      Jika anda ingin menggunakan fungsi visualisasi atau buku nota Jupyter, pasang juga modul `qiskit.visualization`. Lihat [rujukan API Visualisasi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"      </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"local-jupyter\"></span>\n"
"1. If you want to run a Jupyter notebook with the Qiskit packages you just installed, you need to install Jupyter in your environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"local-jupyter\"></span>\n"
"1. Jika anda ingin menjalankan buku nota Jupyter dengan pakej Qiskit yang baru dipasang, anda perlu memasang Jupyter dalam persekitaran anda.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install jupyter\n"
"      ```\n"
"    Then open your notebook as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install jupyter\n"
"      ```\n"
"    Kemudian buka buku nota anda seperti berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      jupyter notebook <path/to/notebook.ipynb>\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      jupyter notebook <path/to/notebook.ipynb>\n"
"      ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are planning to work locally and use simulators built into Qiskit, "
"then your installation is done. If you want to run jobs on IBM&reg; QPUs, "
"continue on to [set up your IBM Cloud&reg; account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda merancang untuk bekerja secara tempatan dan menggunakan simulator "
"yang dibina dalam Qiskit, maka pemasangan anda sudah selesai. Jika anda "
"ingin menjalankan kerja pada QPU IBM, teruskan ke [sediakan akaun IBM Cloud "
"anda](cloud-setup).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [Qiskit release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit` by running `pip install -U qiskit`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Kekal terkini dengan versi terbaharu\">\n"
"Semak secara berkala [nota keluaran Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes) untuk melihat keluaran baharu. Kami mengesyorkan anda kerap mengemaskini keperluan untuk `qiskit` dengan menjalankan `pip install -U qiskit`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

