msgid "Windows 64-bit (Windows 10 and later supported)\n"
msgstr ""
"Linux AArch64 (pengedaran yang serasi dengan spesifikasi pembungkusan "
"[manylinux 2014](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0599/))\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
